15
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:50,000
So the doctors are not allowed to touch the women. They send you down to the matron.

16
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:56,000
So when he went to examine me, he said,

17
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:59,000
You're a very sick woman. You better go down to the matron.

18
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:09,720
nervous and upset that my pulse was going so fast and I couldn't talk and I

19
00:02:09,720 --> 00:02:14,840
was holding my coat around my stomach see so they wouldn't and I guess he

20
