thought I was pregnant see because the bottles all start to move to the front

21
00:02:22,480 --> 00:02:27,640
so he says oh like a sick woman you better go down to the matron and all I

22
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:32,840
kept thinking about was oh they ever find those bottles I'll have to stay on

23
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:39,480
ship a month to pay up for if you could they find you $50 a bottle I think I had

24
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:43,880
eight and I was broke because I

25
00:02:43,880 --> 00:02:59,040
spent my money and she didn't examine me she said what's the matter I said I'm so

26
00:02:59,040 --> 00:03:02,000
nervous I said

27
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:05,940
doctors, they're fooling around. I said, my friend in front, they threw the bottle

28
00:03:05,940 --> 00:03:11,460
overboard and I got all nervous and upset. And she says, well I'll give you a

29
